# Build context for services/loom_web_gateway/Dockerfile only (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore).
# The image installs its own dependencies with `npm ci`; a node_modules left in the checkout must never be
# copied over them. One from Electron 36 did exactly that and failed every deploy after the move to 44.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-electron
**/.cursor-build
.git
.cache
.loom
artifacts
